    "summary": "A DRUKHARI Army Faction can bring HARLEQUINS or ANHRATHE units without the DRUKHARI Faction keyword. Count their points together for the battle size allowance: 250 for Incursion, 500 for Strike Force and 750 for Onslaught. Models in those units are ineligible for WARLORD and cannot receive Enhancements.",
